# Allowlist: ignore everything, then allow only known-safe files.
# The rules behind this are in CLAUDE.md. Snapshots must show fictional data only.
*
!*/
!*.py
!*.html
!*.css
!*.js
!*.sh
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!LICENSE
!.gitignore
!.nojekyll
!manifest.json
!snapshots/*/*.png

# Never, even if matched above. These come last so they win.
data/
CLAUDE.local.md
*.db
*.sqlite*
*.csv
*.log
.env*
*.pem
*.key
known_hosts
*.bak
*.old
*.orig
*~
__pycache__/
node_modules/
